ind":"announcement","title":"Live again: round two with the Spell Death demo","summary":"Back for round two. The first stream went better than I expected, so I am pushing my luck. Spell Death is a roguelike deckbuilder where the alphabet is your deck. Draw letters, spell words, hit demons. Longer words hit harder, and some letters are printed on paper that changes the rules. Come hang out, throw words at me in chat, and grab the free demo right here.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:20:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696652","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117230-1846651706694921","game_id":"steam-5117230","kind":"announcement","title":"Live: the dev plays the Spell Death demo","summary":"Going live on this page. I made Spell Death alone, and now I get to play it in front of people. Brave or stupid, we will find out. You draw letters, spell words, and the words hit demons. Longer words hit harder. Chat gets to suggest words, I get to fail at them. The demo is free, right here on the store page. Wishlist if you like what you see.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117230-1846651706686272","game_id":"steam-5117230","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.9.0 — Spell in 7 more languages (Beta)","summary":"New: spell in your own language (Beta) You can now spell in German, Spanish, French, Portuguese (Brazil), Polish, Russian and Turkish, not only English. Every letter deck, tier and Lexicon word is rebuilt for each language. How to switch: Settings → GAME → Spelling Language. On first launch the game asks once if you want to spell in your interface language. A run keeps the language it started with, so the change applies to your next run. The Daily Climb has a separate leaderboard for each langua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:26:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117230-1846651706676848","game_id":"steam-5117230","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: Daily Climb, eleven languages, and a lot of fixes","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo and wrote in. This covers the last few demo updates. New Daily Climb. One seeded run per day, the same for everyone. Same letters, same map, same demons. It has its own Steam leaderboard, so you can see how your vocabulary stacks up. Eleven languages. The game now plays in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil), Polish and Turkish. Pick one in Settings. If something reads wrong in your languag","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:47:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676848","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5117230-1844751498234428","game_id":"steam-5117230","kind":"announcement","title":"Join Spell Death's Beta Test","summary":"As Steam Fest is getting closer, I have ramped up feedback gathering for a perfect demo week, thus I've decided to reach out to anyone out there who wants to play the game, give their feedbacks for a chance toName a garmentName a contrabandName a bossOr get the full game earlyAll you gotta do is fill the form and wait for an email from me to get the key.Two things:Key needs to be activated within 24 hours or it will be expiredKey will arrive in your mailbox from me, dont freak out. Here is the l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T14:30:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234428","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:47:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5117230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5117230":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5117230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z"},"5117270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:23:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5117230","app_id":5117230,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:32Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"93e5ddf13850cd318d9e16df8bef53bee693d9f6c0ecde9a9cfef52e671f0e79","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"알파벳이 곧 덱이 되는 로그라이크 덱빌딩 게임. 문자를 뽑아 단어를 만들어 공격하고, 막고, 저주하세요. 규칙을 바꾸는 용지에 문자를 인쇄하고, 악마마다 숨긴 진짜 이름을 알아내 읽기를 멈춘 아르데코 도시에서 추방하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Serhat Marasligil"}],"developers":[{"name":"Serhat Marasligil"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794906000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"공개 트레일러","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791695